flowchart TD
  START[读取 extent / B树节点] --> PICK[bch2_bkey_pick_read_device]
  PICK --> PTRS[遍历解码后的指针]
  PTRS --> UNWRITTEN{指针.unwritten？}
  UNWRITTEN -- yes --> HOLE[返回零填充]
  UNWRITTEN -- no --> HARD{强制要求设备？}
  HARD -- yes --> MATCH{指针.dev == 偏好设备？}
  HARD -- no --> DEVLOOKUP[从指针.dev解析设备]
  MATCH -- no --> NEXT_PTR[跳过指针]
  MATCH -- yes --> DEVLOOKUP
  DEVLOOKUP --> ONLINE{设备在线？}
  ONLINE -- no --> EC{有 ec？}
  EC -- yes --> RECON[标记重构]
  EC -- no --> NEXT_PTR
  ONLINE -- yes --> STALE{缓存的指针已过期？}
  STALE -- yes --> NEXT_PTR
  STALE -- no --> FAILS[查询失败计数器]
  FAILS --> SCORE[按延迟平方计分]
  SCORE --> BEST{优于当前选择？}
  BEST -- yes --> KEEP[更新选择]
  BEST -- no --> NEXT_PTR
  KEEP --> NEXT_PTR
  NEXT_PTR --> PTRS
  PTRS --> END{已有选择？}
  END -- yes --> OK[使用选定设备]
  END -- no --> ERR[返回无设备 / I/O 错误 / 校验错误]
